### HomeAccess API — Pruebas con REST Client (VS Code)
### Instala la extensión: humao.rest-client
### Clic en "Send Request" sobre cada bloque para ejecutar

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@token = PEGAR_ACCESS_TOKEN_AQUI

# ══════════════════════════════════════════
# AUTH
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### 1. Registrar usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombres": "Admin",
  "apellidos": "Principal",
  "cedula": "1234567890",
  "email": "admin@conjunto.co",
  "password": "Admin1234",
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### 2. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@conjunto.co",
  "password": "Admin1234"
}

###

### 3. Obtener perfil (requiere token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Renovar token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PEGAR_REFRESH_TOKEN_AQUI"
}

# ══════════════════════════════════════════
# USUARIOS
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### 5. Listar usuarios (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&limit=10&sort=createdAt:desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5b. Crear usuario (admin crea desde el panel)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombres": "Juan",
  "apellidos": "Residente",
  "cedula": "9876543210",
  "tipo_documento": "CC",
  "email": "juan.residente@mail.com",
  "celular": "+573001234567",
  "role": "residente",
  "password": "Residente123"
}

###

### 6. Detalle de usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/PEGAR_USER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ══════════════════════════════════════════
# UNIDADES
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### 7. Listar unidades
GET {{baseUrl}}/units?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. Crear unidad
POST {{baseUrl}}/units
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numero": "301",
  "torre": "A",
  "piso": 3,
  "tipo": "apartamento",
  "estado": "desocupado"
}

# ══════════════════════════════════════════
# CONTROL DE ACCESO
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### 9. Registrar acceso
POST {{baseUrl}}/access-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo_persona": "visitante",
  "nombre_visitante": "Juan Visitante",
  "tipo_acceso": "entrada",
  "porteria": "Principal",
  "metodo": "manual"
}

###

### 10. Listar accesos (últimos 20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-logs?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 11. Personas actualmente adentro
GET {{baseUrl}}/access-logs/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ══════════════════════════════════════════
# PAQUETES
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### 12. Listar paquetes pendientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/packages?estado=en_porteria
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 13. Registrar paquete
POST {{baseUrl}}/packages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "remitente": "Amazon",
  "transportadora": "Coordinadora",
  "guia": "COO123456789",
  "tipo": "paquete",
  "unit_destino": "PEGAR_UNIT_ID",
  "destinatario_id": "PEGAR_USER_ID"
}

###

### 14. Entregar paquete
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/packages/PEGAR_PACKAGE_ID/entregar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entregado_a": "PEGAR_USER_ID"
}

###

### 15. Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/health
